WEBVTT

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:31.676
once the country gets back up on its feet
and we open things up,

00:01:31.676 --> 00:01:32.956
everything will be fine.

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:34.756
Well, two years later,

00:01:34.756 --> 00:01:38.756
men have fully recovered
all of their job losses.

00:01:38.756 --> 00:01:40.556
Women are still missing.

00:01:40.556 --> 00:01:43.476
And, you know, the latest labor statistics

00:01:43.516 --> 00:01:45.836
does not account for the amount of women

00:01:45.876 --> 00:01:48.196
who have downshifted their careers,

00:01:48.236 --> 00:01:50.556
who have said, "Oh, I'm working full time,

00:01:50.596 --> 00:01:51.996
I got to work part time now,"

00:01:51.996 --> 00:01:54.836
because, again, half of daycare centers
are still shut down.

00:01:54.876 --> 00:01:56.756
Schools are still kind of inconsistent.

00:01:56.756 --> 00:02:00.076
We still have a broken structure of care.